      "origin": "Synthetic. The repository states its fixtures are hand-authored against the transaction-set structure, with nothing captured from a feed, a clearinghouse sample or a partner's test file, and nothing de-identified from anything. Structure is factual; no implementation-guide text is reproduced.",
      "covers": "Medicare-shaped professional remittance, multi-claim, PLB with a WO offset, mixed CARC and RARC, a deliberately unbalanced file, and a clearinghouse quirk."
